### =====================================================
### TEST FLIGHTS API - After Seeding Data
### =====================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5042/api/v1
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### =====================================================
### 1. Search Flights - HAN to SGN Today
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?departureAirportCode=HAN&arrivalAirportCode=SGN&departureDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd'}}&passengers=1
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 2. Search Flights - SGN to HAN Tomorrow
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?departureAirportCode=SGN&arrivalAirportCode=HAN&departureDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd' 1 'd'}}&passengers=2
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 3. Search Flights - HAN to DAD (Next Week)
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?departureAirportCode=HAN&arrivalAirportCode=DAD&departureDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd' 7 'd'}}&passengers=1
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 4. Get Flight Details by ID (Replace with actual ID)
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/1
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 5. Get Available Seats for Flight
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/1/seats
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 6. Admin - Get All FlightDefinitions
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/flight-definitions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 7. Admin - Get FlightDefinition by ID
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/flight-definitions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 8. Admin - Get Flights by Definition
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/flight-definitions/1/flights?startDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd'}}&endDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd' 7 'd'}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 9. Admin - Get All Flights (Paginated)
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/FlightsAdmin?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 10. Search Round Trip - HAN to SGN and back
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?departureAirportCode=HAN&arrivalAirportCode=SGN&departureDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd' 3 'd'}}&returnDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd' 10 'd'}}&passengers=2&tripType=1
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 11. Get Flights by Date Range
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights?startDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd'}}&endDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd' 7 'd'}}
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 12. Get Popular Routes
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/popular-routes
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 13. Check Seat Availability
### =====================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/flights/check-availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightId": 1,
  "seatClassId": 1,
  "passengerCount": 2
}

### =====================================================
### 14. Get Flight Statistics (Admin)
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/flights/statistics?startDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd'}}&endDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd' 30 'd'}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### 15. Search Flights with Filters
### =====================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?departureAirportCode=HAN&arrivalAirportCode=SGN&departureDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd'}}&passengers=1&minPrice=1000000&maxPrice=3000000&seatClass=Economy
Content-Type: application/json

### =====================================================
### NOTES:
### - Replace {{token}} with actual JWT token from login
### - Replace flight IDs with actual IDs from database
### - Dates are auto-generated using {{$datetime}} variable
### - Use REST Client extension in VS Code to run these requests
### =====================================================
